### ⚡ Add Missing Features

**1. LSP Auto-rename (CRITICAL for refactoring):**
```lua
-- Add to setup():
lsp_file_methods = {
    enabled = true,
    timeout_ms = 1000,
    autosave_changes = true,  -- Auto-save when renaming files
},
```

**2. Better git integration:**
```lua
-- Add to setup():
git = {
    add = function(path) return true end,     -- Auto git-add new files
    mv = function(src, dest) return true end, -- Auto git-mv renamed files
    rm = function(path) return true end,      -- Auto git-rm deleted files
},
```

**3. Add columns for better visibility:**
```lua
columns = {
    "icon",
    "permissions",  -- Shows rwx permissions
    "size",         -- File size
    "mtime",        -- Last modified time
},
```

